            "abstract": "The gravitational lensing effect provides various ways to study the mass environment of <b>galaxies</b>. We investigate how <b>galaxy</b>-<b>galaxy</b>(-<b>galaxy</b>) lensing can be used to test models of <b>galaxy</b> formation and evolution. "
