            "abstract": "<b>Galaxy</b> clusters grow by accreting <b>galaxies</b> from the field and along filaments of the cosmic web. As <b>galaxies</b> are accreted they are affected by their local environment before they enter (pre-processing), and traverse the cluster potential. "
